SUMMARY:Deadline: Stimuleringsfonds: Open Call Residency Suriname 2027 (Par
 amaribo\, Moengo\, Frederiksdorp)
DESCRIPTION:The Creative Industries Fund NL (Stimuleringsfonds) is recruiti
 ng one Netherlands-based designer\, architect or interdisciplinary maker f
 or a three-month residency in 2027 across three locations in Suriname: Par
 amaribo\, Moengo and Frederiksdorp\, each with its own cultural\, historic
 al and social context.\n\nOrganisation: Stimuleringsfonds Creatieve Indust
 rie (Creative Industries Fund NL) with local partner organisations in Suri
 name\nLocation: Residency takes place at three locations in Suriname: Para
 maribo\, Moengo and Frederiksdorp. Applicants must be established in the N
 etherlands\, Aruba\, Bonaire\, Curacao\, Saba\, Sint Eustatius or Sint Maa
 rten (Kingdom of the Netherlands) and registered in a business register wi
 thin the Kingdom of the Netherlands.\nAward: EUR 8\,500 subsidy for a thre
 e-month residency\, paid by the Creative Industries Fund NL. One residency
  position is awarded. No application fee.\nDuration: Three months in 2027\
 , moving between Paramaribo\, Moengo and Frederiksdorp\n\nMore: https://ww
 w.stimuleringsfonds.nl/en/grants/open-call-residency-suriname?utm_source=a
 rtificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.stimuleringsfonds.nl/en/grants/open-call-residency-suriname
 ?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
